    started_at {
      seconds: 1786797738
      nanos: 449211722
    }
  }
  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Project Architecture**\n\nI\'m now diving into the architecture of SAVE 2.0 (Rep\303\272blica Dominicana). The goal is a clean, modular design. I\'ve begun reviewing the core entities and modules needed, with a strong focus on separating concerns (RN-072 to RN-07).\n\n\n**Elaborating Variable Engine**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the variable engine. I am defining its internal snake_case format, and supported types, as well as complex composite objects like person and address. I\'m also specifying Dominican-specific validators and utility functions, including currency validation and number-to-words conversion for Dominican Spanish. These validations should add some real value.\n\n\n**Developing Core Components**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the core components. I am prioritizing the `date format` handling, including date formatting as text (\"a los quince (15) d\303\255as del mes de agosto del a\303\261o dos mil veintis\303\251is\"). I am also creating the `derived variables engine`, to manage `renta_mensual_letras`, `deposito_calculado`, `duracion_meses`, `monto_itbis`, and other variables. The focus is atomic propagation of renamed variables, orphan detection, and missing reference detection. The `clause engine` with a clause library (Dep\303\263sito de garant\303\255a, Mora) and `rule engine` are also under way.\n\n\n**Designing API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now deeply involved in the design of the API, specifically the `/api/analyze` endpoint. I\'m focusing on a robust system that uses Dominican regex and rule-based extractors, accompanied by confidence scores. I\'m leveraging Gemini AI for deeper context analysis. I\'m also thinking through a Human-in-the-Loop review system, split-screen, and real-time form generation with live validations. I am also working on a template health check engine.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 791529396
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
