  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Builder**\n\nOkay, I\'m starting to build out the `GoogleFormsTemplateEditor.tsx` component. The core focus is on creating a visual, Google Forms-like builder for configuring and editing the template. Right now, I\'m thinking about the user interface and how to represent the form elements visually. I\'m aiming for an intuitive drag-and-drop experience.\n\n\n**Defining the Components**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out the structure of the builder, starting with the main elements. A visually distinct template title area is planned, with color accents. I\'m focusing on \"Sections,\" or \"Bloques Tem\303\241ticos,\" and the specific \"Question Cards\" that will populate them. Each question card has a title, and a field-type dropdown, with validators and formatting for data types.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
