  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Pricing Page**\n\nI\'m now laser-focused on recreating the Pricing Page from the provided image assets. I\'m starting with a pixel-perfect recreation of the header, which includes the SAVE monogram, navigation links like \"Templates\" and \"Pricing,\" and login/signup buttons. Next, I\'ll be working on the title: \"Transparent pricing for modern\"\n\n\n**Defining the Price Cards**\n\nI\'ve just moved on to the core of the pricing page: defining the price cards. I\'m focusing on the first price card, the \"Single Template\" option. I\'ve designed the badge, the pricing, and the supporting description and its features list, with checkmarks. I\'ve got a button now for plan selection, and I\'m moving on to building the other pricing cards.\n\n\n**Constructing the Checkout**\n\nI\'m now deep in the checkout flow design. I\'ve outlined the sections: contact information, payment details, and order summary. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the \"Enterprise\" price card, ensuring its \"Contact Sales\" button leads to the appropriate next steps. I\'ve also just designed the security notice, with lock icon, to give the buyer confidence. Now, the checkout will also offer a preview icon.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Welcome Page**\n\nI\'m now integrating the trust badges, specifically the 256-BIT SSL, SECURE STRIPE, and LEGAL GRADE, into the design. The footer\'s coming along nicely, with the SAVE emblem and copyright notice with legal & social links. I\'ve also incorporated the interactive Bento Grid with the precise deep forest green. This includes the \'Plataforma de Alta Precisi\303\263n Notarial y Legal\' title and the primary calls to action: \"Explorar Plantillas Notariales\", \"B\303\263veda de Contratos Finales\", \"Ver Planes & Precios\", and \"Crear Nueva Plantilla.\"\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 15
      nanos: 221822235
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
